```

Host: `firebase deploy --only hosting`. Add Firestore for chat history (free quotas handle it).[14][7]

## Staying Free
- Monitor console quotas daily.
- localStorage for sessions, Firestore only for key chats.
- Test in Replit/SPK first, deploy when ready—your mobile workflow shines here.[15]

